{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/996b8e09c80bd820163e51b01c7dd0e6.poster.avif?t=1771379561\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/996b8e09c80bd820163e51b01c7dd0e6.webm?t=1771379561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/996b8e09c80bd820163e51b01c7dd0e6.mp4?t=1771379561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gin - The Silver Wind is a retro inspired platformer that features its own take on classic controls seen in games from the late 80s and early 90s. Take control of Gin and plan your jumps with precision as you wind through stages filled with tight platforming sections and deadly hazards!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/dd7abd310538221b7da9458f9eee2d19.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a jumping movement similar to certain old-school classics, having a fixed arch. Master the double jump in order to maneuver through the stages and successfully avoid enemies and hazards as you plan your position and landing beforehand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/44916e431755895582e5a654cd45f719.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gin can attack with his blade to cut through enemies and objects with the power of the wind. You can also use your blade to hook onto surfaces, allowing you to climb walls and help you out in a pinch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/f29a604eb45cb5993b5e4bcb1e324d9c.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your tornado ability to leap forward as you become immune to any harm while slicing any enemies that get in your way or use it as an extra option for maneuvering mid-air. <br><br>Combining different timing and type of jumps as well as the use of your tornado can lead to different results of movement. Be creative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/ffbe3f1795e2c25523ec951ec1584737.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing damage to enemies fills up your Strain Circle, fill it up and activate Strain Mode to speed up the use of the tornado. Master all of Gin's tools and become as nimble as the Silver Wind himself!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2582780?t=1771379561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771379561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/d68bd4398e161505a4ea7701dfea3273ed9c010c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771379561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/d68bd4398e161505a4ea7701dfea3273ed9c010c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771379561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2592150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/996b8e09c80bd820163e51b01c7dd0e6.poster.avif?t=1771379561\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/996b8e09c80bd820163e51b01c7dd0e6.webm?t=1771379561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/996b8e09c80bd820163e51b01c7dd0e6.mp4?t=1771379561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gin - The Silver Wind is a retro inspired platformer that features its own take on classic controls seen in games from the late 80s and early 90s. Take control of Gin and plan your jumps with precision as you wind through stages filled with tight platforming sections and deadly hazards!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/dd7abd310538221b7da9458f9eee2d19.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a jumping movement similar to certain old-school classics, having a fixed arch. Master the double jump in order to maneuver through the stages and successfully avoid enemies and hazards as you plan your position and landing beforehand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/44916e431755895582e5a654cd45f719.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gin can attack with his blade to cut through enemies and objects with the power of the wind. You can also use your blade to hook onto surfaces, allowing you to climb walls and help you out in a pinch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/f29a604eb45cb5993b5e4bcb1e324d9c.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your tornado ability to leap forward as you become immune to any harm while slicing any enemies that get in your way or use it as an extra option for maneuvering mid-air. <br><br>Combining different timing and type of jumps as well as the use of your tornado can lead to different results of movement. Be creative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/extras/ffbe3f1795e2c25523ec951ec1584737.avif?t=1771379561\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealing damage to enemies fills up your Strain Circle, fill it up and activate Strain Mode to speed up the use of the tornado. Master all of Gin's tools and become as nimble as the Silver Wind himself!</p>","developers":["Jackal In A Box"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582780/9985b1b260662de729a04168fe4734b84010d724/header.jpg?t=1771379561","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92023-2026 Jackal In A Box","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>R